/issues/2136#issuecomment-262828463","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/2136","id":262828463,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI2MjgyODQ2Mw==","user":{"login":"jart","id":49262,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MjYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49262?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jart","html_url":"https://github.com/jart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-11-24T18:20:42Z","updated_at":"2016-11-24T18:20:42Z","body":"I've identified the problem. zlib web server sends `Content-Encoding: gzip` for a gzip file. My change is meant to automatically un-gzip when that happens, even though it shouldn't for the `.gz` extension.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncurl jart@compy:~/code/tensorflow-clean$ curl -I http://zlib.net/zlib-1.2.8.tar.gz\r\nHTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\nDate: Thu, 24 Nov 2016 18:17:44 GMT\r\nServer: Apache/2.4.18 (Unix) OpenSSL/1.0.1e-fips mod_bwlimited/1.4\r\nLast-Modified: Mon, 29 Apr 2013 00:33:14 GMT\r\nETag: \"6109a7f-8b6d3-4db7507b80680\"\r\nAccept-Ranges: bytes\r\nContent-Length: 571091\r\nContent-Type: application/x-gzip\r\nContent-Encoding: gzip\r\n```\r\n\r\nI'm writing a fix right now. I'm going to send it straight to the GitHub repo as a pull request unless you ask me to send it somewhere else.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.co